s as both a value bet against weaker pairs/ace-high and applies pressure on drawing hands. This allows me to take control of the pot while risking relatively little (only 1.5% of my stack). If they have a 10 or J and call or raise, I can fold without significant damage.\n\nAnswer: 300"}
